{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55695","headline":"钱唐潮信诗 · 赞宁","name":"钱唐潮信诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"午未未未申，申（《西湖游览志》作「寅」）卯卯辰辰，巳巳巳午午，朔望一般轮。\n（见元陶宗仪《南村辍耕录》卷十二。\n）（按：明田汝成《西湖游览志》卷二四收此爲「杭人」诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赞宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}